    "text": "If the line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> lies in the plane <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfies the equation of the plane<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />And <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>n</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"〉\" open=\"〈\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow>&nbsp;</mfenced><mtext>and&nbsp;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>n</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"〉\" open=\"〈\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mf